# Day 19 – Football Intelligence Hub with Claude

## Objective

Build an AI-powered Football Intelligence Hub that combines sports analytics, World Cup predictions, football knowledge assessment, and personality analysis into a single interactive experience.

## What I Built

Today I created a Football Intelligence Hub using Claude that guides users through three stages:

1. FIFA World Cup 2026 Prediction Report
2. Football IQ Assessment
3. Messi vs Ronaldo Personality Match

The system generates a complete Football Intelligence Profile based on user responses and workbook data.

## Features

### World Cup Prediction Engine

* Predicted winner, runner-up, and dark horse teams
* Confidence scores for each prediction
* Supporting evidence and risk analysis
* Player watchlist

### Football IQ Quiz

* Knowledge-based football assessment
* Adaptive questions
* Football Awareness Score
* Fan classification system

### Personality Assessment

* Messi vs Ronaldo compatibility analysis
* Football personality archetype generation
* Leadership and decision-making evaluation
* Personalized football recommendations

